<title>FRANCE: GdesEaux sells Cannes casino stake.</title>
<headline>GdesEaux sells Cannes casino stake.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Generale des Eaux unit Compagnie Generale d'Immobilier et de Services (CGIS) said on Monday it had sold its entire holding in Societe Fermiere du Casino Municipal de Cannes (SFCMC) to the Partouche group.</p>
<p>CGIS said it sold its 30.3 percent stake in the Cannes casino for 280 million francs.</p>
<p>It said that Diane Barriere-Desseigne remained majority holder of SFCMC.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
